# Allowed Bash prefixes for the orchestrator ITSELF.
#
# Enforcement is now a single GLOBAL hook (settings.json) that dispatches by the
# payload's `agent_type` to the matching <agent>.allowlist. So each agent is
# governed ONLY by its own file — no stacking, no superset. This list therefore
# needs to cover only what the orchestrator runs directly: inbox DISCOVERY.
# Everything else (reads, labels, filters, modifications) is delegated to
# subagents, each gated by its own allowlist.
gws gmail users messages list
gws gmail users threads list
gws schema

# Pipelines into these read-only filters are also permitted by bash-guard
# (safe read-only filters, enforced in bash-guard.py SAFE_FILTERS):
#   jq grep head tail cut sort uniq wc tr cat rev nl column
# e.g.  gws gmail users messages get --params '{...}' | jq '.payload.headers'
